    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.2c">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV As</ref> 6.2c</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ sece swylce socne swylce he sece, þæt he ne sy his feores wyrðe, butan swa feola nihta swa he we her beufan cwædon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But let him seek what sanctuary he may, his life shall be spared only for as many days as we have declared above.</ab>
      </div>
